OL,3,GNEWSAOperation Brock cost #1.4m over
OL,4,Athe summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA holding system for lorries queuing to
OL,7,Fcross the English Channel cost #1.4m to
OL,8,Fdeploy in July and August, it has been
OL,9,Frevealed.
OL,11,FOperation Brock sees temporary barriers
OL,12,Fset up on the M20, which allows one
OL,13,Fcarriageway to be used as a lorry park
OL,14,Fshould there be disruption at the
OL,15,FChannel ports.
OL,17,FA Freedom of Information request by the
OL,18,FBBC found the system was activated five
OL,19,Ftimes, for a total of 34 hours, while
OL,20,Fin place between 13 July and 16 August.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
