OL,3,GNEWSAOperation Brock cost #1.4m over
OL,4,Athe summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FToby Howe of the Kent and Medway
OL,7,FResilience Forum said the scheme was "a
OL,8,Fvery expensive option" but ultimately
OL,9,F"the only option" to manage traffic
OL,10,Fflows.
